; Changed for Xpeccy+ on 2026-11-08: TAPE_KIND_MSGS and START_MESSAGES were one byte
; early, on the end of the text before them; moved to #09C1 and #1539, where the 48K
; list names them BLOCK_HDR and COPYRIGHT, so they are left out here.
;
; Converted to the Debugger's text format on 2026-11-20 (docs/debugger-format.md):
; rom NAME <MD5 of a 16K bank> [skip what that bank has not], the bundled images
; above it; NAME:ADDR LABEL a name; db/dw/da/dm/dc NAME:ADDR LENGTH data, N*K for
; K statements of N.
; plus3-41.rom bank 3
rom BASIC48_SPP3_41_3 ef7bf942a1c1f9ed5d583d0a49e26db7
BASIC48_SPP3_41_3:386E BASIC48.INT_KBD_MOTOR
BASIC48_SPP3_41_3:387C BASIC48.INT_KBD_END
BASIC48_SPP3_41_3:387F BASIC48.MOTOR_TIMEOUT
